#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid "<title>Do not stretch or rotate pixels</title><p>For Fuji Super CCD cameras, show the image tilted 45 degrees. For cameras with non-square pixels, do not stretch the image to its correct aspect ratio. In any case, this option guarantees that each output pixel corresponds to one RAW pixel.</p>"
msgstr ""

